   "act": "state",
   "guide": "The speaker states the content in their own words.",
   "content": [
    {
     "text": "Consume xml & schema documents Parsers (dom, sax) Check conformance Well-formed Validate Create validation constraints shall enable a meaningful sharing of XML-based schemas and related information. Extract semantically-valid views from an XML document (e.g., XSL) Disassemble hierarchical view to relational representation Render",
     "role": "statement"
    }
   ]
  },
